  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Live view of `server/scripts/smoketestsuit/run.py` as it runs \u2014 built from the server's own Fastify access logs (`incoming request` / `request completed`), shipped file -> Promtail -> Loki, no changes to the smoke-test suite itself.\n\n- **Step panel** below groups requests into the suite's own 5 traffic-producing steps (`01-bootstrap` .. `05-returns-workflow`) exactly as named in `output/<run-id>/summary.txt`.\n- **`06-reconciliation` produces zero HTTP traffic** \u2014 it re-reads the database directly (`lib/db.py`), so it will never show a bar here; that's expected, not a gap.\n- **Endpoint panel** breaks the same window down by individual route, for drill-down.\n- Narrow the time range to a single `run.py` invocation to see its steps light up in order."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Smoke Test Steps \u2014 Request Volume",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "P8E80F9AEF21F6940"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "sum",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"node-nginx-clean-server\"} |= \"incoming request\" |= `\"url\":\"/api/health\"` [$__interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "01 Bootstrap (health)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"node-nginx-clean-server\"} |= \"incoming request\" |~ `\"url\":\"(/api/accounts|/api/accounts/verify|/api/v1/addresses|/api/v1/wallet)` [$__interval]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "02 Populate Users (register/verify/address/wallet)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"node-nginx-clean-server\"} |= \"incoming request\" |= `\"url\":\"/api/v1/apparel/groups\"` [$__interval]))",
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "03 Populate Products (apparel groups)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"node-nginx-clean-server\"} |= \"incoming request\" |~ `\"url\":\"(/api/v1/acquisitions/buy-now|/api/admin/shipments/[^\"]+/tracking|/api/v1/acquisitions/[^\"]+/confirm-receipt|/api/admin/wallets/[^\"]+/release-item)` [$__interval]))",
          "refId": "D",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "04 Purchase Workflow (buy-now/ship/confirm-receipt/release)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"node-nginx-clean-server\"} |= \"incoming request\" |~ `\"url\":\"(/api/v1/acquisitions/[^\"]+/return-request|/api/admin/returns/)` [$__interval]))",
          "refId": "E",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "05 Returns Workflow (return-request/CS decision)"
        }
      ]
    },
